### Storybook Packager release artifacts ###
# The disk image is hosted on the GitHub release for its tag, not in the repository. Committing it
# each release is what grew .git past 200MB; the appcast points at the release asset instead.
StorybookPackager/updates/*.dmg
StorybookPackager/updates/*.zip
dist/
